# Code owners for Stampd.
#
# GitHub uses this file to auto-request reviews on PRs. When combined with the
# branch protection rule "Require review from Code Owners", a change can't
# merge until the relevant owner approves. Closes OSSF Scorecard's
# BranchProtectionID "codeowners review is not required" warning.
#
# Format: <pattern> <@user> [@user...]
# More specific patterns at the bottom override more general patterns at the top.

# Default — everything in the repo needs review from the maintainer.
*                                            @isureshsubramanian

# Cryptography + signing paths — extra-sensitive, always reviewed by the
# maintainer regardless of who pushes other changes in the same PR.
/src/Stampd.Engine/Pades/                    @isureshsubramanian
/src/Stampd.Engine/Sealing/                  @isureshsubramanian
/src/Stampd.Crypto.*/                        @isureshsubramanian
/src/Stampd.Timestamp.*/                     @isureshsubramanian
/tests/Stampd.Engine.Tests/                  @isureshsubramanian

# Security policy + workflows — protection in depth.
/SECURITY.md                                 @isureshsubramanian
/.github/                                    @isureshsubramanian
